  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Climate Resilience and Environmental Sustainability in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overarching goal of this project is to strengthen the climate, environment and natural resources (CENR) sector capacities to leverage financial and technical resources to achieve the sustainable management of natural resources and adapt to climate change. The project is in line with National Strategy for Transformation-2, UNDP Country Programme Document and United Nations Sustainable Development Cooperation Framework (UNSDCF) that put emphasis on adaptation and mitigation to climate change,</narrative>
  </description>
